{"v":1,"id":"5aea2fa13eda","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"You will never know the stone cold grave,","s":18.11,"e":20.9},{"t":"nor hang from a criminal’s tree.","s":20.98,"e":26.38},{"t":"Never taste that severed breath","s":26.44,"e":29.2},{"t":"when heaven seemed far from Me.","s":29.26,"e":31.46},{"t":"You will never sweat out drops of blood","s":31.56,"e":37.74},{"t":"in a garden pressed alone.","s":37.82,"e":43.14},{"t":"Never hear brutes haggle your garments.","s":43.19,"e":46.26},{"t":"Hung bare, stripped down to bone.","s":46.32,"e":51.3},{"t":"As they pierced My side and lifted Me high,","s":51.34,"e":55.95},{"t":"arms opened wide between earth and sky…","s":56.04,"e":59.6},{"t":"I was brought down low in My passion.","s":59.68,"e":62.91},{"t":"I bore that hour to make you Mine.","s":63.03,"e":66.24},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":66.24,"e":66.81},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":66.84,"e":70.39},{"t":"Love does not turn away.","s":70.4,"e":75.43},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":75.53,"e":77.5},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":77.61,"e":79.27},{"t":"I bore the price that day.","s":79.39,"e":84.28},{"t":"I hope you never feel what I feel","s":84.29,"e":87.21},{"t":"when the earth is filled with violence.","s":87.25,"e":92.7},{"t":"When rivers of tears and blood run dry","s":92.76,"e":95.5},{"t":"and heaven answers silence.","s":95.61,"e":98.03},{"t":"My heart is very heavy.","s":98.08,"e":103.05},{"t":"I take no pleasure at all.","s":103.08,"e":103.83},{"t":"As My hand draws back in anger,","s":103.94,"e":106.22},{"t":"Tears continue to fall.","s":106.25,"e":106.72},{"t":"My blood runs down - and they refuse it.","s":106.74,"e":112.05},{"t":"My tears fall like rain - yet they turn away.","s":112.15,"e":124.6},{"t":"They heap up death with willing hands.","s":124.64,"e":127.86},{"t":"Still they choose it.","s":127.9,"e":129.13},{"t":"They choose death.","s":129.16,"e":132.95},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":132.96,"e":134.71},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":134.81,"e":136.66},{"t":"Love does not delight in flame.","s":136.72,"e":140.69},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":140.8,"e":142.69},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":142.79,"e":144.43},{"t":"Yet still I am the same.","s":144.53,"e":149.4},{"t":"As they bruise Me and spit in My face,","s":149.41,"e":153.54},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":153.64,"e":157.47},{"t":"As they pierce My side,","s":157.53,"e":158.96},{"t":"blood and tears run down together.","s":158.99,"e":165.56},{"t":"As My own people drive in the nails,","s":165.64,"e":168.55},{"t":"I am lifted from My place,","s":168.67,"e":172.99},{"t":"arms spread apart, waiting still","s":173.09,"e":176.41},{"t":"to receive them in embrace.","s":176.53,"e":180.52},{"t":"Oh My people… why?","s":180.58,"e":184.2},{"t":"why have you forsaken Me?","s":184.26,"e":186.04},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":186.1,"e":186.94},{"t":"You forsake Me.","s":187.02,"e":193.68},{"t":"Forsake Me?","s":193.72,"e":195.98},{"t":"Me?","s":196.09,"e":196.66},{"t":"Why forsake Me?","s":196.72,"e":199.17},{"t":"This sorrow will not rise again.","s":199.17,"e":200.7},{"t":"This ruin must not remain.","s":200.73,"e":204.0},{"t":"Love will purge what love must purge","s":204.06,"e":225.32},{"t":"Death can not reign.","s":225.4,"e":229.39},{"t":"I take no pleasure in what must be done ,","s":229.47,"e":232.7},{"t":"no pleasure at all.","s":232.8,"e":236.81},{"t":"Evil will not toil forever.","s":236.89,"e":239.22},{"t":"Our tears will cease to fall.","s":239.32,"e":241.77},{"t":"fall","s":241.87,"e":242.55},{"t":"fall","s":242.65,"e":243.51},{"t":"fall","s":243.61,"e":244.41},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":244.43,"e":246.49},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":246.6,"e":247.68},{"t":"But not for endless years.","s":247.78,"e":250.64},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":250.66,"e":251.2},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":251.22,"e":251.76},{"t":"My blood runs down.","s":251.86,"e":254.47},{"t":"My tears run down.","s":254.57,"e":256.1},{"t":"Purging sorrows and fears.","s":256.16,"e":260.16},{"t":"I am come down.","s":260.19,"e":262.74},{"t":"Not divided in My heart.","s":262.82,"e":268.48},{"t":"Love that bled for you","s":268.56,"e":270.8},{"t":"now takes man's kingdoms apart.","s":270.9,"e":273.64},{"t":"I AM.","s":273.75,"e":276.98},{"t":"I AM.","s":277.1,"e":284.16},{"t":"I AM come down!","s":284.28,"e":286.29},{"t":"down","s":286.39,"e":287.15},{"t":"down","s":287.25,"e":292.58},{"t":"down","s":292.67,"e":293.14}],"match":null}
